     A* =================================================================
     A* File Name   : EXTRPGDTL (PF2)
     A* Description : Member Detail Metrics Physical File
     A* Format Name : EXTRPGDTLR
     A* Author      : IBM i Extraction Utility Team
     A* Columns     : Library / Source File / Member name / Member type /
     A*               total lines / exec lines / non exec lines
     A* =================================================================
     A          R EXTRPGDTLR                TEXT('Member Detail Metrics')
     A            SRCLIB        10A         COLHDG('Source' 'Library')
     A            SRCFILE       10A         COLHDG('Source' 'File')
     A            SRCMBR        10A         COLHDG('Member' 'Name')
     A            SRCTYPE       10A         COLHDG('Member' 'Type')
     A            TOTLINES      10S 0       COLHDG('Total' 'Lines')
     A            EXELINES      10S 0       COLHDG('Executable' 'Lines')
     A            NONEXELIN     10S 0       COLHDG('Non-Exec' 'Lines')
